@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Select the Test Boundary for the Required Guarantee
start
:Identify exact criterion and observable invariant;
if (Pure domain / policy decision?) then (yes)
 :Deterministic unit case with explicit clock and inputs;
 :Assert result and meaningful forbidden / allowed effect;
else (no)
 if (Depends on database / filesystem / concurrency?) then (yes)
  :Real persistence / storage integration case;
 else (no)
  :Actual protocol, browser or recovery check
for the relevant boundary;
 endif
endif
:Use fakes only within their stated simulation limits;
:Record candidate, setup, expected and observed outcome;
if (Failure or evidence gap?) then (yes)
 :Link diagnosis / corrective work and retest scope;
else (no)
 :Link bounded result to exact criterion;
endif
stop
@enduml
